WEBVTT

00:06:58.642 --> 00:07:00.560
because there's no visual at all.

00:07:00.584 --> 00:07:04.697
And I'm out there kind of tripping out
on my little playlist.

00:07:04.721 --> 00:07:07.225
(Laughter)

00:07:07.249 --> 00:07:10.293
I've got tight rubber caps,
I don't hear a thing.

00:07:10.317 --> 00:07:13.434
I've got goggles and I'm turning
my head 50 times a minute,

00:07:13.458 --> 00:07:14.733
and I'm singing ...

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:18.099
(Singing) Imagine there's no heaven

00:07:18.123 --> 00:07:19.710
(Laughter)

00:07:19.734 --> 00:07:21.416
doo doo doo doo doo

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:24.260
It's easy if you try

00:07:24.284 --> 00:07:25.488
doo doo doo doo doo

00:07:25.512 --> 00:07:28.046
And I can sing that song
a thousand times in a row.

00:07:28.070 --> 00:07:30.305
(Laughter)